{
  "title": "ISic001358. Funerary inscription for Iulianus",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">ἐτελεύτησεν</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">Ἰουλιανὸς</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\">τῇ</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\">πρὸ</span>  <span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ιε</span>´ <span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">κ<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">αλ</span>(ανδῶν)</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"Ἀπριλίων\">Ἀπριλίων</span>  <span data-text=\"ζή\n                    σας\">ζή-<br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>σας</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη</span> ν´ <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>Α 𐆠 Ω </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗΣΕΝ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">ΙΟΥΛΙΑΝΟΣ</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\">ΠΡΟ</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΙΕ</span><span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">Κ<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΑΛ</span></span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"Ἀπριλίων\">ΑΠΡΙΛΙΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ζή\n                    σας\">ΖΗ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΣΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ΕΤΗ</span>Ν<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>Α𐆠Ω</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text: IG</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Alex Antoniou</a></p>  <p>Ioulianos died 15 days before the Kalends of April, having lived for 50 years</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription is Christian, as suggested by the particular attention devoted to recording the day of the deceased's death and by the final Christogram. For the name <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἰουλιανός</span> in Sicily, see IG XIV 126 (= <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000943\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000943</a>), from Syracuse.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Amico 1741 267 no. IX <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186</a>  </li><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9489 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a></li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">539</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
  "divs": [
    {
      "id": "editions",
      "html": "<div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">ἐτελεύτησεν</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">Ἰουλιανὸς</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\">τῇ</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\">πρὸ</span>  <span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ιε</span>´ <span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">κ<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">αλ</span>(ανδῶν)</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"Ἀπριλίων\">Ἀπριλίων</span>  <span data-text=\"ζή\n                    σας\">ζή-<br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>σας</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη</span> ν´ <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>Α 𐆠 Ω </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗΣΕΝ</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">ΙΟΥΛΙΑΝΟΣ</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\">ΠΡΟ</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΙΕ</span><span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">Κ<span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΑΛ</span></span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"Ἀπριλίων\">ΑΠΡΙΛΙΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ζή\n                    σας\">ΖΗ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΣΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ΕΤΗ</span>Ν<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>Α𐆠Ω</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div>"
