      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Alex Antoniou</a></p>  <p>Ioulianos died 15 days before the Kalends of April, having lived for 50 years</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription is Christian, as suggested by the particular attention devoted to recording the day of the deceased's death and by the final Christogram. For the name <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἰουλιανός</span> in Sicily, see IG XIV 126 (= <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000943\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000943</a>), from Syracuse.</p>  "
    },
